#: src/x11/wzx-main.c:296
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Usage: wmake-zones [OPTION | COMMAND [ARGUMENT]]\n"
"\n"
"Window zones and tiling for Window Maker and wlmaker.\n"
"\n"
"Options:\n"
"  (none)            start the service (X11)\n"
"  -d, --dockapp     start with the tile in the Window Maker Dock/Clip\n"
"      --session     used at login: stays only if Zones or Auto Tiling is on\n"
"      --reset       turn everything off and give Window Maker its\n"
"                    WindowSnapping back\n"
"  -h, --help        show this help\n"
"      --version     show the version\n"
"\n"
"Commands (sent to the running service, X11 or wlmaker):\n"
"  status                     state, monitors, work areas and layouts\n"
"  mode zones|tiling|off      organization mode; toggle switches Zones and\n"
"                             Tiling, enable turns off or back on\n"
"  zones on|off|toggle        snap zones while dragging\n"
"  autotile on|off|toggle     automatic tiling\n"
"  layout ID|next|prev        zone layout of the monitor under the pointer\n"
"  layouts                    available layouts\n"
"  algorithm NAME             master, columns, rows, grid, bsp, monocle,\n"
"                             spiral, dwindle\n"
"  snap N                     put the active window in zone N\n"
"  move|swap|focus left|right|up|down\n"
"  restore | restore-all      back to the size and place before snapping\n"
"  float | promote | grow | shrink | arrange\n"
"  undo | redo                undo or redo the last change\n"
"  picker                     choose a zone with the keyboard\n"
"  preview TREE               show a layout for a moment, e.g. \"H(2,1)\"\n"
"  windows [-l]               open windows (-l: monitor, zone and geometry)\n"
"  editor | prefs [PAGE]      open the zone editor or the preferences\n"
"  overlay                    state of the zones overlay (diagnostics)\n"
"  reload | log | ping | quit\n"
"\n"
"Configuration: ~/.config/wmake-zones/wmake-zones.conf\n"
msgstr ""
"Uso: wmake-zones [OPÇÃO | COMANDO [ARGUMENTO]]\n"
"\n"
"Zonas de janelas e mosaico para o Window Maker e o wlmaker.\n"
"\n"
"Opções:\n"
"  (nenhuma)         inicia o serviço (X11)\n"
"  -d, --dockapp     inicia com o ladrilho no Dock/Clip do Window Maker\n"
"      --session     usado no login: só fica se Zones ou Auto Tiling estiver "
"ligado\n"
"      --reset       desliga tudo e devolve ao Window Maker o\n"
"                    WindowSnapping dele\n"
"  -h, --help        mostra esta ajuda\n"
"      --version     mostra a versão\n"
"\n"
"Comandos (enviados ao serviço em execução, X11 ou wlmaker):\n"
"  status                     estado, monitores, áreas úteis e layouts\n"
"  mode zones|tiling|off      modo de organização; toggle alterna Zonas e\n"
"                             Mosaico, enable desliga ou religa\n"
"  zones on|off|toggle        zonas de encaixe ao arrastar\n"
"  autotile on|off|toggle     mosaico automático\n"
"  layout ID|next|prev        layout de zonas do monitor sob o ponteiro\n"
"  layouts                    layouts disponíveis\n"
"  algorithm NOME             master, columns, rows, grid, bsp, monocle,\n"
"                             spiral, dwindle\n"
"  snap N                     põe a janela ativa na zona N\n"
"  move|swap|focus left|right|up|down\n"
"  restore | restore-all      volta ao tamanho e ao lugar de antes do "
"encaixe\n"
"  float | promote | grow | shrink | arrange\n"
"  undo | redo                desfaz ou refaz a última mudança\n"
"  picker                     escolhe uma zona pelo teclado\n"
"  preview ÁRVORE             mostra um layout por um instante, ex.: "
"\"H(2,1)\"\n"
"  windows [-l]               janelas abertas (-l: monitor, zona e "
"geometria)\n"
"  editor | prefs [PÁGINA]    abre o editor de zonas ou as preferências\n"
"  overlay                    estado do overlay das zonas (diagnóstico)\n"
"  reload | log | ping | quit\n"
"\n"
"Configuração: ~/.config/wmake-zones/wmake-zones.conf\n"

